5. Custodian Services
Where the fund engages the services of a custodian, we note:
a) Notwithstanding the custodian is engaged to assist with the holding,
safeguarding and administration of certain fund assets, we are responsible for
investment decisions and to ensure the fund’s investment strategy is complied
with;
b) We are responsible for establishing the terms under which the custodian is
engaged;
c) Investments and other reports are received at least quarterly, or more often as
required;

b) The individual trustees have been nominated, have consented to act and may
only be removed in such manner and circumstances as are allowed in the
governing rules;
c) No trustee is a disqualified person;
d) The trustee has not recognised, encouraged or sanctioned an assignment of an
interest in the fund by a member or beneficiary;
e) The trustee has complied with the investment standards set out in SIS; and
f) Information retention obligations have been complied with.
